mutation let a location completion win after a newer user action
detects LatestLocation
-     /\ LET writes == r[2] = generation
-            allowed == r[1] = serial /\ mode = "locate"
+     /\ LET writes == TRUE
+            allowed == r[1] = serial /\ mode = "locate"

mutation preserve the previous generation while typing a search
detects LatestLocation
-     /\ generation' = generation+1
+     /\ generation' = generation

mutation accept an older successful arrival response for the same stop
detects LatestBoard
-            writeOK == r[2] = generation /\ stationOK
+            writeOK == stationOK

mutation display a late arrival failure at the same stop
detects LatestBoard
-            writeError == r[2] = generation /\ stationOK
+            writeError == stationOK

mutation preserve the previously selected stop during a manual search
detects EmptySearch
-     /\ mode' = "query" /\ selected' = 0 /\ board' = Empty
+     /\ mode' = "query" /\ selected' = selected /\ board' = Empty

mutation preserve the previous arrival display during a manual search
detects EmptySearch
-     /\ mode' = "query" /\ selected' = 0 /\ board' = Empty
+     /\ mode' = "query" /\ selected' = 0 /\ board' = board

mutation apply a stale nearby dataset after a manual search
detects LatestCatalog
-     /\ LET writes == r[2] = generation
-            allowed == r[1] = serial /\ mode = (IF r[3] = "nearby" THEN "locate" ELSE "query")
+     /\ LET writes == r[3] = "nearby" \/ r[2] = generation
+            allowed == r[1] = serial /\ mode = (IF r[3] = "nearby" THEN "locate" ELSE "query")

mutation show a stale manual result or error after a newer search
detects LatestCatalog
-     /\ LET writes == r[2] = generation
-            allowed == r[1] = serial /\ mode = (IF r[3] = "nearby" THEN "locate" ELSE "query")
+     /\ LET writes == r[3] = "query" \/ r[2] = generation
+            allowed == r[1] = serial /\ mode = (IF r[3] = "nearby" THEN "locate" ELSE "query")

mutation render a successful payload reporting the wrong station ID
detects SameStationBody
-            acceptBody == bodyStop = r[4]
+            acceptBody == TRUE

mutation 50fb4b8 wait for a button click instead of starting geolocation on mount
detects AutoStart
-         /\ board = Empty /\ pending = {BootGPS} /\ results = FALSE /\ hit = "mount"
+         /\ board = Empty /\ pending = {} /\ results = FALSE /\ hit = "mount"

mutation send an arrivals request even for a locally displayed map stop
detects MapOnly
- Arrival(t,g,s) == IF Remote(s) THEN {<<t,g,"arrival",s>>} ELSE {}
+ Arrival(t,g,s) == {<<t,g,"arrival",s>>}

mutation show the previous arrival when selecting a map-only stop
detects MapOnly
-     /\ selected' = s /\ board' = Empty
+     /\ selected' = s /\ board' = IF Remote(s) THEN Empty ELSE board
